The reason I brought it up is a more profound issue than just finding
specific items.  Nethack now easily contains over 70 dungeon levels in
a typical winning game.  Given normal treasure generation, guarenteed
items and death drops, the player will typically find nearly all the
things the game can generate on a single trip.  As Nethack's size has
increased substantially the number items that can be found in the
dungeon has not.  Sokoban already generates one random ring and wand
per level, and tons of food.  One way to combat this is to add more
stuff.

